1Ki 13:1 , Jeroboam's hand withers
1Ki 13:6 , and at the prayer of the prophet is restored;
1Ki 13:7 , The prophet departs from Beth-el;
1Ki 13:11 , An old prophet brings him back;
1Ki 13:20 , He is reproved by God
1Ki 13:23 , slain by a lion
1Ki 13:26 , buried by the old prophet
1Ki 13:31 , who confirms his prophecy;
1Ki 13:33 , Jeroboam's obstinacy.
